WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.366 --> 00:00:03.833
Our heroes have arrived in Anistar City,

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.233
where Serena and her Pokémon are busy rehearsing

3
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.666
for the upcoming Pokémon Showcase!

4
00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:09.966
And... ♪ Ta-da! ♪

5
00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:12.566
- Braixen!
- Pancham!

6
00:00:14.266 --> 00:00:18.000
- That was awesome, Serena!
- Yeah! You're so cool!

7
00:00:18.066 --> 00:00:19.133
Thank you all so much!

8
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.500
Looks like you're all set for tomorrow.

9
00:00:21.566 --> 00:00:26.300
I wish. No, not yet! That is, if I want to perform as well as Aria.

10
00:00:26.366 --> 00:00:28.733
- Braixen!
- Pancham!

11
00:00:30.566 --> 00:00:33.800
- Eevee!
- Eevee, that's so nice!

12
00:00:33.866 --> 00:00:36.866
Be sure to watch tomorrow's showcase. We're gonna win.

13
00:00:36.933 --> 00:00:39.000
Then we'll perform together the next time!

14
00:00:39.066 --> 00:00:40.133
Vee?

15
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.800
Bunnelby, I'm glad you're here, too. Eevee's much more relaxed with you around.

16
00:00:44.866 --> 00:00:47.100
- Bunnelby.
- Eevee.

17
00:00:47.166 --> 00:00:48.166
Huh?

18
00:00:48.233 --> 00:00:50.133
- Chespin, che!
- Eevee! Eevee!

19
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.533
- Che! Chespin! Che, che! Pin?
- Eevee! Eevee!

20
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.666
- Chespin, pin.
- Bunnel.

21
00:00:54.733 --> 00:00:56.533
- Come on, Chespin!
- Che!

22
00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.666
You don't wanna scare Eevee.

23
00:00:58.733 --> 00:01:02.566
Sorry, Chespin. I'm sure Eevee will get used to things soon.

24
00:01:02.633 --> 00:01:04.000
- Che.
- There you are!

25
00:01:04.066 --> 00:01:05.400
- Huh?
- Pika?

26
00:01:05.466 --> 00:01:09.133
Hey, you guys! Long time no see!

27
00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.900
Hi, Tierno!

28
00:01:10.966 --> 00:01:12.766
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

29
00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:14.533
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

30
00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.966
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

31
00:01:18.033 --> 00:01:19.433
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

32
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:23.266
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

33
00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:26.533
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

34
00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.966
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

35
00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:33.933
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

36
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.633
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

37
00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.900
♪ Pokémon! ♪

38
00:01:45.166 --> 00:01:47.900
Tag Team Battle Inspiration!

39
00:01:51.266 --> 00:01:53.166
One, two, three, four!

40
00:01:56.566 --> 00:01:58.466
- Ah!
- Blastoise.

41
00:01:59.766 --> 00:02:02.466
How's it goin', everybody? It's great to see you!

42
00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:03.966
- Blastoise!
- And you...

43
00:02:04.033 --> 00:02:06.966
- I'm super-happy to see you!
- Huh?

44
00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:08.966
Thanks. Nice to see you, too.

45
00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:11.800
- Hey, Tierno?
- Huh? Yeah?

46
00:02:11.866 --> 00:02:14.300
Your Wartortle has evolved into a Blastoise!

47
00:02:14.366 --> 00:02:18.466
You bet. We've been practising our rhythmic battle routines ever since!

48
00:02:18.533 --> 00:02:21.433
Oh! You're big!

49
00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:23.966
Blast!

50
00:02:24.033 --> 00:02:26.533
That's great!

51
00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.766
Blastoise. The Shellfish Pokémon.

52
00:02:28.833 --> 00:02:32.500
Blastoise's heavy body weight can leave opponents unable to battle.

53
00:02:32.566 --> 00:02:35.200
It retreats into its shell when necessary.

54
00:02:35.266 --> 00:02:38.666
- A Blastoise, huh?
- Huh. They're not here yet, are they?

55
00:02:38.733 --> 00:02:39.900
Huh?

56
00:02:39.966 --> 00:02:43.433
- Hey, guys!
- Huh? Oh!

57
00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.833
- You made it here before we did!
- Ha! I'm number one!

58
00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:51.133
- Shauna! How have you been?
- Just fine! How about you?

59
00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.300
I'm great!

60
00:02:52.366 --> 00:02:54.866
- Will you be in the Pokémon Showcase?
- Yeah!

61
00:02:54.933 --> 00:02:58.133
Looks like we're in for some heated performances tomorrow.

62
00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.733
Yay! Can't wait!

63
00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:01.533
- Denne-ne!
- Chespin, Chespin!

64
00:03:02.833 --> 00:03:05.033
- Braixen.
- Saur.

65
00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.033
- Braixen.
- Pancham. Pancham, Pancham.

66
00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.466
- Cham, Pancham.
- Brai?

67
00:03:08.533 --> 00:03:09.733
- Pan, Pancham!
- Braixen!

68
00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.300
Huh?

69
00:03:11.366 --> 00:03:14.200
All set? I'll bet you've been working hard, Serena!

70
00:03:14.266 --> 00:03:17.366
- Am I right?
- Yup! And this time, I'll win!

71
00:03:17.433 --> 00:03:18.766
Bring it on!

72
00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:21.733
- What do you say, Ivysaur?
- Ivysaur.

73
00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.866
Bulbasaur evolved into an Ivysaur!

74
00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.700
Ivysaur. The Seed Pokémon.

75
00:03:27.766 --> 00:03:33.066
As Ivysaur takes in nutrients, a large flower blooms from the bulb on its back.

76
00:03:33.133 --> 00:03:34.633
Oh, wow!

77
00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:37.066
I saw you perform at the Dendemille Showcase.

78
00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:40.233
So your Fennekin evolved into a Braixen?

79
00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.966
- Braixen's looking good!
- Thanks!

80
00:03:43.033 --> 00:03:44.900
- Braixen!
- Pancham!

81
00:03:44.966 --> 00:03:47.466
Wow. An Eevee!

82
00:03:47.533 --> 00:03:48.533
Bunn, Bunnelby.

83
00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.900
-Now, is Eevee your partner, too?

84
00:03:50.966 --> 00:03:53.033
Sure is!

85
00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:56.566
- Eevee, this is Shauna.
- Eevee?

86
00:03:56.633 --> 00:03:58.733
She's a friend.

87
00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:02.266
- You see, Eevee is just a bit timid.
- Aw!

88
00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:06.733
It lived in the forest alone, so it's not used to having so many people around.

89
00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:07.833
It'll get used to it.

90
00:04:09.466 --> 00:04:12.500
I'm jealous! You have so many performance possibilities,

91
00:04:12.566 --> 00:04:14.633
depending on how you raise Eevee!

92
00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:16.300
- Possibilities?
- Yeah!

93
00:04:16.366 --> 00:04:19.600
For example, if it evolves into Flareon, a Fire type,

94
00:04:19.666 --> 00:04:22.533
you can do an awesome fiery performance with Braixen!

95
00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:25.366
- Flareon!
- Braixen!

96
00:04:27.866 --> 00:04:30.833
But if it evolves into Leafeon, a Grass type,

97
00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:33.533
a performance with Pancham would be really interesting!

98
00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:34.433
♪ Ta-da! ♪

99
00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.566
Or Umbreon. A Dark-type Pokémon!

100
00:04:40.133 --> 00:04:43.400
There's also Glaceon, an Ice type!

101
00:04:43.466 --> 00:04:44.700
Aah!

102
00:04:44.766 --> 00:04:46.900
And Espeon, a Psychic type.

103
00:04:46.966 --> 00:04:50.666
Espe!

104
00:04:51.833 --> 00:04:54.733
Or Jolteon, an Electric type!

105
00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:55.733
Vee?

106
00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:57.700
Vaporeon's a Water type.

107
00:04:57.766 --> 00:04:59.700
Vaporeon!

108
00:05:00.966 --> 00:05:04.600
And finally, there's Sylveon, a Fairy type!

109
00:05:04.666 --> 00:05:05.800
Eon!

110
00:05:05.866 --> 00:05:09.300
Just think of it! Depending on how Eevee evolves,

111
00:05:09.366 --> 00:05:11.866
there are lots of performance possibilities!

112
00:05:11.933 --> 00:05:15.300
Wow! I didn't realise I had so many options!

113
00:05:15.366 --> 00:05:18.666
- Amazing, don't you think?
- Eevee?

114
00:05:18.733 --> 00:05:22.500
Now, it's really up to you to bring out one of those possibilities.

115
00:05:22.566 --> 00:05:25.966
- You can do it!
- Mm-hm. I'll do my best!

116
00:05:26.033 --> 00:05:29.500
Hey, why isn't Trevor with you guys?

117
00:05:29.566 --> 00:05:32.333
The plan was, he was supposed to come with us,

118
00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:36.300
but... he found another Pokémon that's not in his photo collection yet,

119
00:05:36.366 --> 00:05:38.900
so he's been chasing it around.

120
00:05:38.966 --> 00:05:42.900
- That's Trevor, all right!
- For sure!

121
00:05:42.966 --> 00:05:46.633
Oh cool! I'd really like to know what Pokémon Trevor's looking for.

122
00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:48.666
I'd really like to know, too!

123
00:05:48.733 --> 00:05:51.900
- So, the next time we see him, we'll ask!
- Mm-hm.

124
00:05:51.966 --> 00:05:55.400
- Ash, challenging the Anistar Gym next?
- Right!

125
00:05:55.466 --> 00:05:58.566
- Well, I already challenged it.
- Wow, you did?

126
00:05:58.633 --> 00:06:00.733
Did you end up earning the Gym Badge?

127
00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:03.666
Nah, I lost.

128
00:06:03.733 --> 00:06:06.566
- Huh?
- Wow, that's quite a surprise.

129
00:06:06.633 --> 00:06:09.166
The Gym Leader there must be strong.

130
00:06:09.233 --> 00:06:13.200
Anistar Gym... It's a Psychic-type gym, if I recall.

131
00:06:13.266 --> 00:06:16.100
- It sure is.
- Whoa. A Psychic-type gym!

132
00:06:16.166 --> 00:06:19.800
What kind of battle was it? It's that hard to win there?

133
00:06:19.866 --> 00:06:22.733
Well... Hm.

134
00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:27.933
It's kind of hard to explain it. It's sort of mysterious and truly incredible.

135
00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:28.866
- Hold on!
- Huh?

136
00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:33.666
- I'll find out for myself instead.
- Pika, pika!

137
00:06:33.733 --> 00:06:35.933
I'll just let it be a surprise.

138
00:06:36.933 --> 00:06:39.066
Good idea. Much better.

139
00:06:39.133 --> 00:06:43.600
That Ash is always so upbeat! That's why you like him, right?

140
00:06:43.666 --> 00:06:45.100
Huh? Like him?

141
00:06:45.166 --> 00:06:49.433
Uh, it is true that his positive mental attitude is something I admire a bit...

142
00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:52.400
- Huh? Wait, what was that?
- Aaaah!

143
00:06:52.466 --> 00:06:54.700
- It wasn't important!
- Uh... OK.

144
00:06:54.766 --> 00:06:56.933
-Oh, boy.

145
00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.733
Bunn.

146
00:06:59.733 --> 00:07:02.000
By!

147
00:07:02.066 --> 00:07:04.033
Chespin, ches.

148
00:07:08.166 --> 00:07:09.666
- Bunn?
- Vee?

149
00:07:09.733 --> 00:07:11.666
Chespin, Chespin!

150
00:07:11.733 --> 00:07:15.000
Eevee, Eevee, Eevee, Eevee, Eevee, Eevee... Eevee!

151
00:07:15.066 --> 00:07:19.366
- Vee, vee, vee!
- Eevee?

152
00:07:19.433 --> 00:07:21.533
Pin, pin, ches.

153
00:07:22.533 --> 00:07:25.000
- Pin...
- Hey!

154
00:07:25.066 --> 00:07:27.366
Chespin, you stay right here.

155
00:07:27.433 --> 00:07:29.000
Ches! Ches!

156
00:07:29.066 --> 00:07:32.366
- Oh, poor Chespin...
- Eevee's really shy.

157
00:07:32.433 --> 00:07:35.700
- It'll really be with you in the Showcase?
- Mm-hm.

158
00:07:35.766 --> 00:07:39.000
- My hope is Eevee will be in the next one.
- I see.

159
00:07:39.066 --> 00:07:43.000
But lots of people always show up, so Eevee might get nervous.

160
00:07:43.066 --> 00:07:45.066
It could be a little bit of a problem!

161
00:07:46.066 --> 00:07:48.500
Hm...

162
00:07:48.566 --> 00:07:52.966
Yeah, you're right. Eevee's still not all that comfortable with us.

163
00:07:53.033 --> 00:07:56.700
Nah. Eevee seemed just fine when I came up to it slowly.

164
00:07:57.866 --> 00:08:00.466
And Eevee knows how to dance incredibly well.

165
00:08:00.533 --> 00:08:03.800
- Really?
- I do wish you all could see it dance.

166
00:08:03.866 --> 00:08:05.466
It's just beautiful!

167
00:08:07.533 --> 00:08:10.100
- Eevee?
- Don't worry!

168
00:08:10.166 --> 00:08:12.433
I'm sure you're gonna keep working really hard.

169
00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:16.066
And before you know it, you'll be performing your dance for everybody!

170
00:08:16.133 --> 00:08:16.966
Pika!

171
00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:21.700
- Braixen, Braixen, brai.
- Pancham, pan.

172
00:08:21.766 --> 00:08:23.633
Eevee.

173
00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:24.700
Eevee!

174
00:08:24.766 --> 00:08:27.366
Hey, I know what! Let's go train!

175
00:08:27.433 --> 00:08:29.466
- Huh?

176
00:08:29.533 --> 00:08:32.366
- You talk way too loud.
- Pika, pika!

177
00:08:33.533 --> 00:08:35.433
Eevee-vee.

178
00:08:42.366 --> 00:08:46.366
It's OK. Just try reaching out to them little by little.

179
00:08:46.433 --> 00:08:47.500
Vee.

180
00:08:47.566 --> 00:08:50.600
You should get used to the other Pokémon at your own pace.

181
00:08:50.666 --> 00:08:53.733
Then it won't be long before you're comfortable with everyone!

182
00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.433
Mm-hm. It just takes time, 'kay?

183
00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:58.033
- You can do it!
- Eevee.

184
00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:03.100
- Pin, pin!
- Ee!

185
00:09:03.166 --> 00:09:06.633
- Chespin! Shh!
- Chespin.

186
00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:11.133
Eevee? I'm right here, so you don't have to worry.

187
00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.733
- Ee...
- Bunnel, Bunnelby.

188
00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.466
Ee, ee, ee...

189
00:09:15.533 --> 00:09:19.233
Why is Eevee only comfortable around Bunnelby?

190
00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:21.033
That's something only Eevee knows!

191
00:09:24.966 --> 00:09:27.333
- Denne.
- Eevee.

192
00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.766
- Bunnelby.
- Ee.

193
00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:39.000
Ee... Vee!

194
00:09:39.066 --> 00:09:41.900
- Vee!
- Denne! Denne-ne!

195
00:09:41.966 --> 00:09:45.533
- Vee, vee, vee!
- By, by!

196
00:09:49.466 --> 00:09:52.166
Vee. Vee.

197
00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.100
Vee, vee, vee.

198
00:09:55.166 --> 00:09:57.600
- Denne, denne?
- Froga.

199
00:09:57.666 --> 00:09:59.400
Bunnelby.

200
00:10:00.433 --> 00:10:01.466
Vee.

201
00:10:01.533 --> 00:10:04.133
OK, Pikachu's up next!

202
00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.000
Pika.

203
00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:12.133
Pikachu!

204
00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:18.366
- Now, the last one!
- Yeah, you can do it, Eevee!

205
00:10:18.433 --> 00:10:22.166
Che, che, che, che... Che!

206
00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.200
Vee...

207
00:10:29.266 --> 00:10:31.833
You're doing great. Keep it up!

208
00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:34.533
Vee...

209
00:10:40.133 --> 00:10:42.166
Vee.

210
00:10:43.733 --> 00:10:45.166
Just a bit more.

211
00:10:45.233 --> 00:10:49.166
Vee. Eevee...

212
00:10:49.233 --> 00:10:52.200
- Ches! Che!
- Eevee!

213
00:10:52.266 --> 00:10:55.166
Aw!

214
00:10:55.233 --> 00:10:57.166
Vee, vee, vee!

215
00:10:57.233 --> 00:11:01.966
- Pin. Pin. Che.
- Bunn, bunn.

216
00:11:02.966 --> 00:11:06.800
- I think this is gonna take a little time.
- Mm-hm.

217
00:11:13.033 --> 00:11:15.733
Who's that Pokémon?

218
00:11:20.033 --> 00:11:21.966
It's Ivysaur!

219
00:11:22.033 --> 00:11:23.933
Ivysaur.

220
00:11:28.466 --> 00:11:30.700
You were good. Really!

221
00:11:31.766 --> 00:11:32.733
Eevee?

222
00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:36.200
Eevee, is it too much?

223
00:11:36.266 --> 00:11:39.233
Does performing in front of all those people make you scared?

224
00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.833
- Huh?
- Vee?

225
00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:43.566
You don't have to do it if you don't want to.

226
00:11:43.633 --> 00:11:48.100
Eevee! Eevee, vee, vee, vee! Eevee, vee, vee... Eevee!

227
00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.100
Really? Does that mean you want to dance?

228
00:11:52.166 --> 00:11:55.100
Eevee! Eevee!

229
00:11:55.166 --> 00:11:57.333
Thank you so much!

230
00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:00.933
And now, it's time to see this week's number one!

231
00:12:02.566 --> 00:12:05.166
It's Aria!

232
00:12:14.133 --> 00:12:17.833
Do you know who she is? That's the reigning Kalos Queen.

233
00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:22.300
I wanna be just like her. I even got to meet Aria a while back!

234
00:12:22.366 --> 00:12:23.900
You know what she taught me?

235
00:12:23.966 --> 00:12:26.566
Something really important that I'll always remember!

236
00:12:26.633 --> 00:12:29.066
- Braixen.
- Cham.

237
00:12:30.066 --> 00:12:31.533
Eevee?

238
00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:35.566
A Pokémon performer always has to wear a wonderfully radiant smile!

239
00:12:36.566 --> 00:12:39.766
That's the way you make everyone in your audience happy!

240
00:12:39.833 --> 00:12:40.666
Yeah.

241
00:12:47.633 --> 00:12:51.366
- Braix!
- Now... this battle's really heating up!

242
00:12:51.433 --> 00:12:54.266
Time to show us the bond between all of you!

243
00:12:55.366 --> 00:12:57.866
- That's it!
- A battle?

244
00:12:57.933 --> 00:13:02.366
- Mm-hm.
- Sounds fun. Count me in!

245
00:13:02.433 --> 00:13:05.700
- You're having a battle? Count me in too!
- Pika!

246
00:13:05.766 --> 00:13:08.933
- Oh! Thank you, everyone!
- So why don't we have a Tag Battle?

247
00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.133
A Tag Battle, huh? What teams?

248
00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:14.533
Serena and me. And how does you and Tierno sound?

249
00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:18.266
- Sounds awesome! Should be a lot of fun!
- I'm game!

250
00:13:18.333 --> 00:13:21.900
- And you, Serena?
- Mm-hm. Perfect!

251
00:13:21.966 --> 00:13:24.666
Would you like to be my battling partner, Eevee?

252
00:13:24.733 --> 00:13:28.933
- We might get good performance ideas!
- Eevee!

253
00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:44.300
All right! It's Serena and Shauna versus Ash and Tierno!

254
00:13:44.366 --> 00:13:47.166
The Tag Battle will now begin!

255
00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:52.433
Trainers will only use one Pokémon each, and the battle will be over

256
00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:55.266
when both Pokémon on either team are unable to continue!

257
00:13:55.333 --> 00:13:57.933
- Hm.
- Hm.

258
00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.266
- Go, all of you!
- Braixen!

259
00:14:00.333 --> 00:14:01.933
- Cham, cham!
- Bunnelby!

260
00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.500
- Chespin, pin!
- Gadier!

261
00:14:03.566 --> 00:14:05.733
- Eevee.
- Eevee?

262
00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:10.233
Remember, you're battling with me. So you're not alone.

263
00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:12.400
Ee? Eevee!

264
00:14:12.466 --> 00:14:15.900
- Now, let's win it with style, Ivysaur!
- Ivy.

265
00:14:15.966 --> 00:14:18.566
All right, everyone, battle begin!

266
00:14:22.966 --> 00:14:26.466
- Let's do it! Pikachu, Electro Ball!
- Pika!

267
00:14:26.533 --> 00:14:29.333
Pika, pika, pi!

268
00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:33.300
I knew Ash would go first. Ivysaur, use Energy Ball!

269
00:14:33.366 --> 00:14:35.200
Saur!

270
00:14:38.133 --> 00:14:40.966
- That was great, Shauna!
- So were you, Ash!

271
00:14:41.033 --> 00:14:45.100
Hey, hey, hey! Now, time for our rhythmic battle style!

272
00:14:45.166 --> 00:14:47.900
'Kay, Blastoise, Rapid Spin!

273
00:14:50.966 --> 00:14:52.733
Eevee, Protect!

274
00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:54.133
Eevee!

275
00:14:58.300 --> 00:15:01.600
- Whoa. Hey, not bad!
- Use Razor Leaf!

276
00:15:01.666 --> 00:15:03.266
Sa. Sa, sa, sa, sa, sa, sa, saur!

277
00:15:03.333 --> 00:15:05.533
Take some steps backwards! Yeah!

278
00:15:08.533 --> 00:15:10.466
- Yeah!
- Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

279
00:15:10.533 --> 00:15:13.800
Pikachu!

280
00:15:13.866 --> 00:15:16.966
- Dodge it, Eevee!
- Eevee! Eevee, vee, vee.

281
00:15:17.033 --> 00:15:18.966
Eevee, ee, Eevee...

282
00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:23.100
- Eevee!
- Oh, no!

283
00:15:23.166 --> 00:15:25.033
Eevee!

284
00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:30.533
- Ivysaur.
- Eevee?

285
00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:34.866
-Hey there, that was close.

286
00:15:34.933 --> 00:15:36.800
- Are you OK, Eevee?
- Ee?

287
00:15:36.866 --> 00:15:39.133
- Shauna, thanks a lot!
- Ee?

288
00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:41.033
You can do it, Eevee!

289
00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:43.133
-All the way!

290
00:15:44.133 --> 00:15:46.133
- Eevee?
- Eevee?

291
00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:48.500
- Eevee?
- This is what battling's all about.

292
00:15:48.566 --> 00:15:51.233
- Like it?
- Eevee!

293
00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:54.533
There's no way I'm done yet. Time for some rhythm!

294
00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.833
- Eevee? Let's show them!
- Vee, vee.

295
00:15:58.733 --> 00:16:00.133
Eev...

296
00:16:09.366 --> 00:16:10.233
Eevee!

297
00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:13.233
One, two, three, four!

298
00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:16.233
One, two, three, and four!

299
00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:18.466
One, two, three, four!

300
00:16:18.533 --> 00:16:20.900
One, two, and three, and four!

301
00:16:22.466 --> 00:16:25.400
Mm-hm. Show them how you can dance, Eevee!

302
00:16:25.466 --> 00:16:28.266
Hah. Wow! I can't wait to see that!

303
00:16:28.333 --> 00:16:31.900
We'll just have to see if you can keep up with our moves. Yeah!

304
00:16:31.966 --> 00:16:34.033
One, two, three, four!

305
00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.466
- Blast!
- One, two, one, two!

306
00:16:35.533 --> 00:16:37.800
- It's so fast!
- Use Water Gun!

307
00:16:37.866 --> 00:16:39.366
Blastoise!

308
00:16:39.433 --> 00:16:42.000
- Now, Eevee, jump!
- Eevee!

309
00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.100
Vee!

310
00:16:44.166 --> 00:16:45.866
Vee, vee! Eevee!

311
00:16:45.933 --> 00:16:49.600
- Huh? Huh?
- Vee! Vee! Vee! Vee!

312
00:16:49.666 --> 00:16:51.100
Blastoise, Blastoise.

313
00:16:51.166 --> 00:16:54.300
- All right! Look at that!
- Pin, che!

314
00:16:54.366 --> 00:16:59.533
- Great work, Serena! Eevee, too!
- Mm-hm. And we're just getting started!

315
00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:01.100
Vee!

316
00:17:01.166 --> 00:17:03.100
Use Iron Tail!

317
00:17:03.166 --> 00:17:06.366
Pikachu! Aah! Pika!

318
00:17:06.433 --> 00:17:08.033
Saur...

319
00:17:08.099 --> 00:17:11.666
Are you OK, Ivysaur?

320
00:17:11.733 --> 00:17:13.000
- The battle's still on!
- Pi!

321
00:17:13.066 --> 00:17:14.233
Keep your eyes open!

322
00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:18.300
Oh, we will. Ivysaur, Vine Whip, go!

323
00:17:18.366 --> 00:17:19.866
Ivy!

324
00:17:19.933 --> 00:17:22.033
- Dodge it!
- Pika!

325
00:17:22.099 --> 00:17:24.300
Blastoise, keep up with the quick rhythm!

326
00:17:24.366 --> 00:17:26.000
Blast, blast, blast, blast.

327
00:17:26.066 --> 00:17:29.966
- Huh?
- Blast, blast! Blast!

328
00:17:30.033 --> 00:17:32.033
- Gah!
- Bla!

329
00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:33.200
Eevee, quick! Use Swift!

330
00:17:34.833 --> 00:17:37.133
Eevee!

331
00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.033
Ah!

332
00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:42.033
Blast...

333
00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:45.666
- Blastoise!
- Toise.

334
00:17:47.066 --> 00:17:49.633
Wow. That Eevee's really something!

335
00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:52.100
It totally countered all our rhythm tactics!

336
00:17:52.166 --> 00:17:53.000
Yeah.

337
00:17:53.066 --> 00:17:54.333
You're in sync!

338
00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:58.000
Hard to believe it's the first time you and Eevee have battled together.

339
00:18:01.533 --> 00:18:03.166
Huh?

340
00:18:06.633 --> 00:18:10.200
- Serena?
- Yes?

341
00:18:10.266 --> 00:18:12.200
I've got an idea!

342
00:18:12.266 --> 00:18:15.333
- Shauna, can we put this on hold?
- Huh?

343
00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:16.566
Huh?

344
00:18:16.633 --> 00:18:19.666
That move made me think of a new performance routine.

345
00:18:19.733 --> 00:18:21.066
I wanna practise right away!

346
00:18:21.133 --> 00:18:23.900
I'm the one who asked you all to battle.

347
00:18:23.966 --> 00:18:27.833
- I'm sorry!
- Well, if it's for something like that...

348
00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:30.966
- Go give it all you've got!
- Yeah, he's right!

349
00:18:31.033 --> 00:18:34.000
If it's going to be good for your performance, do it!

350
00:18:34.066 --> 00:18:36.933
- Yeah, Serena, good luck!
- You'll be great!

351
00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.600
Thanks! That's really nice of you!

352
00:18:39.666 --> 00:18:43.933
Eevee, Braixen, Pancham, too! Let's go rehearse!

353
00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:46.500
- Braixen!
- Cham!

354
00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.933
- Chespin...
- So, the battle's all done?

355
00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:56.733
No way! We'll just have a battle against each other.

356
00:18:56.800 --> 00:19:00.133
- That sounds good. I'm in, Ash!
- Blastoise!

357
00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:04.400
Then you two go ahead. We're going to work on our performance as well.

358
00:19:04.466 --> 00:19:08.133
- Serena won't get a jump on us!
- Vy.

359
00:19:11.266 --> 00:19:13.100
'Kay, let's keep this going!

360
00:19:13.166 --> 00:19:17.433
All right. The Pokémon battle between Ash and Tierno will now begin!

361
00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:20.733
Better get ready, cos here we come!

362
00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:24.933
- All right, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!
- Pika!

363
00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:29.933
- We're not gonna lose. Hydro Pump, go!
- Blastoise!

364
00:19:34.333 --> 00:19:38.666
See, it would be totally amazing if you could teach us how to dance like you do.

365
00:19:38.733 --> 00:19:40.233
Eevee?

366
00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:44.666
Watching your moves gave me a great idea for a Pokémon Showcase performance!

367
00:19:44.733 --> 00:19:46.166
Vee?

368
00:19:46.233 --> 00:19:48.666
- Braix!
- Chammy, Cham!

369
00:19:48.733 --> 00:19:51.666
Eevee!

370
00:19:51.733 --> 00:19:54.400
Thanks, Eevee! You're the best!

371
00:19:54.466 --> 00:19:56.900
- Braixen!
- Cham, cham!

372
00:19:56.966 --> 00:19:58.400
Eevee!

373
00:19:58.466 --> 00:20:02.100
We'll create our new performance routine together.

374
00:20:02.166 --> 00:20:03.633
- Eevee!
- Cham!

375
00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:05.400
Looks like they're going for it.

376
00:20:05.466 --> 00:20:09.400
So what do you say you and I brush up on our Princess Key performance, too?

377
00:20:09.466 --> 00:20:10.400
Saur, saur.

378
00:20:21.966 --> 00:20:24.100
I can't believe it's so late!

379
00:20:24.166 --> 00:20:26.566
Hey, what time does registration end?

380
00:20:26.633 --> 00:20:29.900
- Real soon!
- We'll make it if we run, right?

381
00:20:29.966 --> 00:20:33.933
The Anistar City Pokémon Showcase is soon to get underway.

382
00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:36.866
Will Serena be able to win her second Princess Key

383
00:20:36.933 --> 00:20:39.400
with the help of Braixen, Pancham, and Eevee?

384
00:20:39.466 --> 00:20:43.966
The exciting answer to come, as the journey continues!
